{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An abstract visual novel about a girl dealing with the challenges of having ADHD while trying to complete a school assignment before the deadline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the short deadline of only seven days looming over her, Clara must navigate the difficulties of life while struggling to complete the project on time. All of this is made more complicated by her ADHD. Things rarely go the way she needs them to, but the choices you make along the journey will ultimately impact the outcome of her story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings depending on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn artwork and photographs mixed together into surreal abstract imagery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depictions of mental health based around real life experiences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542850/extras/dfe82a52c1087cb4d00c6d90c702f285.poster.avif?t=1772812931\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542850/extras/dfe82a52c1087cb4d00c6d90c702f285.webm?t=1772812931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542850/extras/dfe82a52c1087cb4d00c6d90c702f285.mp4?t=1772812931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3542850?t=1772812931","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3542850?t=1772812931","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542850/4174ff68fa5dd85bb9ebd7f8a4